{"id":10465,"date":"2026-04-13T23:09:50","date_gmt":"2026-04-13T23:09:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/?post_type=blogs&#038;p=10465"},"modified":"2026-04-28T23:05:39","modified_gmt":"2026-04-28T23:05:39","slug":"neck-and-shoulder-pain-doctor","status":"publish","type":"blogs","link":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/blogs\/neck-and-shoulder-pain-doctor\/","title":{"rendered":"Top Neck and Shoulder Pain Doctor in Dubai | Dr. Usama Saleh"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10465\" class=\"elementor elementor-10465\" data-elementor-post-type=\"blogs\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fb20153 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3fb20153\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e0dee4b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2e0dee4b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you wake up in the morning and find that you cannot turn your head to greet your spouse, or when a sharp, stabbing sensation shoots from your neck down to your fingertips while you&#8217;re playing with your children, the world can suddenly feel very small.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I see it every day in my clinic: the look of exhaustion in a father\u2019s eyes because he can\u2019t sit at his desk without agony, or the worry on a mother\u2019s face because she can\u2019t lift her toddler. If you are feeling this way, I want you to take a deep breath and know one thing: <\/span><b>I am here to help you.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We don&#8217;t just see a &#8220;cervical spine&#8221; or a &#8220;rotator cuff.&#8221; We see a person whose life has been interrupted by pain. Finding the right <\/span>neck and shoulder pain doctor<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> isn&#8217;t just about finding someone with a diploma on the wall; it\u2019s about finding a partner who will listen to your story, treat your pain with the same urgency they would for their own brother, and guide you back to the life you love in our vibrant city of Dubai.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31427559 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"31427559\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2557a81f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2557a81f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Neck and Shoulder Pain Often Travel Together<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b258603 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7b258603\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is rare to find one without the other. Our bodies are beautifully and complexly connected. The neck (cervical spine) is the bridge between your mind and your body, supporting the weight of your head while allowing you to look at the wonders of the Burj Khalifa or the smiles of your family.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When something goes wrong in the neck, the shoulders often take the &#8220;blame.&#8221; This is called <\/span>referred pain<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Because the nerves that travel to your arms and shoulders originate in your neck, an irritation at the &#8220;source&#8221; can feel like a fire in your shoulder blade.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fa83cff elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3fa83cff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Common causes of neck and shoulder pain<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-164b69ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"164b69ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The &#8220;Tech-Neck&#8221; Epidemic:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> In Dubai&#8217;s fast-paced digital world, we spend hours looking down at phones or hunched over laptops. This puts immense pressure on the delicate structures of the neck.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Muscle Strains:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Simple things, like a stiff neck from an awkward sleeping position or a sudden jerk while driving in busy traffic, can cause micro-tears in the muscles.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The UAE Lifestyle:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Whether it&#8217;s the sudden temperature shifts from the summer heat into heavy air conditioning or the physical stress of frequent travel, our environment plays a role in how our muscles tension up.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5b8c9eb4 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5b8c9eb4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7efee229 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7efee229\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain-1024x576.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-9963\" alt=\"causes of neck and shoulder pain\" srcset=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain-1024x576.webp 1024w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain-300x169.webp 300w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain-768x432.webp 768w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain.webp 1106w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4c0f43fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4c0f43fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Additional connected symptoms other than neck and shoulder pain<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5358d26d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5358d26d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As a <\/span>neck and shoulder pain doctor<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, I believe the first step in healing is listening. Your symptoms are your body\u2019s way of asking for help.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a151c86 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3a151c86\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Are You Experiencing These?<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21272f6d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"21272f6d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The Dull Ache:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> A constant heaviness in the tops of your shoulders that feels like you&#8217;re carrying the weight of the world.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Sharp, Shooting Electric Shocks:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Pain that zaps down your arm when you move your head a certain way.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Numbness or Pins and Needles:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> A tingling sensation in your hands that makes it hard to grip a coffee cup or type.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The Hingeless Feeling:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Stiffness that makes it impossible to check your blind spot while driving or look up at the ceiling.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If these sound familiar, it is time to move beyond temporary rubs and creams. You deserve a definitive answer.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-147db117 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"147db117\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Read also about <a href=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/blogs\/shoulder-blade-pain\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shoulder blade pain treatment in Dubai with Dr. Usama Saleh.<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-535fd04f e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"535fd04f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7827abcb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7827abcb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Dr. Usama\u2019s Approach: The Compassionate Diagnosis Pathway<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5bcf687e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5bcf687e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you come to see me, we start with a conversation. I want to know when the pain started, what makes it better, and- most importantly- what it is stopping you from doing.<\/span><\/p><ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Detailed History:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We talk about your lifestyle, your work, and your hobbies.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The Physical Exam:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> I gently check your reflexes, muscle strength, and exactly where the tenderness lies. I want to see how your &#8220;musculoskeletal family&#8221; is working together.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>State-of-the-Art Imaging:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> If we need to see deeper, <\/span><b>we use:<\/b><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><b>X-Rays:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> To look at the alignment of your bones and check for arthritis.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><b>MRI Scans:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> To see the soft tissues\u2014the discs, nerves, and ligaments\u2014that don&#8217;t show up on X-rays.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><b>EMG (Nerve Tests):<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> To see if a &#8220;pinched nerve&#8221; is the reason your hand feels weak.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f6fc692 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6f6fc692\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis-1024x576.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-9966\" alt=\"shoulder pain diagnosis\" srcset=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis-1024x576.webp 1024w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis-300x169.webp 300w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis-768x432.webp 768w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis.webp 1292w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-622bfb91 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"622bfb91\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b3d2ea9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1b3d2ea9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Treatment Options for neck and shoulder pain<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47de726c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"47de726c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I am a firm believer that <\/span>surgery is the last resort<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, not the first. As your <\/span>neck and shoulder pain doctor<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, my goal is to exhaust every gentle, conservative option before we ever discuss the operating room.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-178f6075 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"178f6075\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Conservative (Non-Surgical) Healing<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65667928 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"65667928\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most of my patients find relief <strong>through a combination of:<\/strong><\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Specialized Physiotherapy:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Not just generic exercises, but movements designed to re-educate your posture and strengthen your core.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Ergonomic Coaching:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We look at how you sit, sleep, and stand. Sometimes, a simple change in your desk height or pillow can be the cure.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Advanced Pain Management:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> This might include targeted injections to calm an inflamed nerve or dry needling to release a stubborn muscle knot.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ee9db17 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1ee9db17\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">When Surgery Becomes a Necessary Friend<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79b1138d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"79b1138d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In cases where there is severe nerve compression or a disc that is truly damaged beyond natural repair, we may discuss surgical options.<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Minimally Invasive Spine Surgery:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We use tiny incisions and advanced cameras to fix the problem with minimal disruption to your body.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Disc Replacement:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> A modern way to maintain your neck\u2019s flexibility while removing the source of the pain.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The recovery from these procedures is much faster than it used to be, and I will be with you every step of the way, from the first &#8220;hello&#8221; in the recovery room to your final check-up.<\/span><\/p><p><strong>Don&#8217;t choose your doctor randomly!<\/strong><br \/>Browse my personal website now and see the <a href=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/shoulder-treatment-dubai\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>shoulder treatment<\/strong><\/a> conditions I offer professionally, as well as what previous clients have to say about them.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-530f9a79 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"530f9a79\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a599967 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3a599967\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Living in Dubai: Prevention and Lifestyle Tips<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f5c83f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7f5c83f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are lucky to live in such a dynamic city, but it comes with its own stresses. <\/span><b>Here is how you can protect your neck and shoulders:<\/b><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The Eye-Level Rule:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Keep your computer and phone at eye level. If you&#8217;re looking down, you&#8217;re putting 20-30 extra pounds of pressure on your neck!<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Stay Hydrated:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Our discs need water to stay bouncy and healthy. In the Dubai heat, this is non-negotiable.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The 30-Minute Break:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Every 30 minutes, stand up, roll your shoulders back, and look at the horizon. It resets your muscle memory.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6aa7ec72 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6aa7ec72\" data-element_type=\"widget\" 